  "story": {
    "day": 27,
    "title": "Kaya's World Travel Gallery",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya visited a photo gallery in Japan on a cold Saturday in January.",
      "First, she saw a picture of a large zoo in America.",
      "Next, she found a photo of a purple tree in France.",
      "She looked out the window and remembered her trip to Canada in June.",
      "Then, a kind woman said \"Hello\" and offered her some hot tea.",
      "Kaya said \"Hi\" and checked the time on her black watch.",
      "After that, she saw a girl with a blue violin in August.",
      "She was happy because she loved travel from October to November.",
      "Finally, she said \"Please show me more\" to the gallery staff on Thursday.",
      "Kaya felt very excited about her next big adventure."
    ]
  }
